flowchart TD
    RTSP[RPi RTSP / 20 FPS] --> WATCH[Cheap motion watcher / 20 FPS]
    RTSP --> POSE[Central pose scheduler]
    BED[Automatic bed segmentation] --> SPACE[Bed spatial context]
    POSE --> TRACK[Primary person tracker]
    TRACK --> CLASS[6-class posture]
    TRACK --> KIN[Legacy kinematic score]
    TRACK --> TCN[Track-owned 10 Hz TCN]
    WATCH --> FUSION[Hybrid shadow fusion]
    SPACE --> FUSION
    CLASS --> FUSION
    KIN --> FUSION
    TCN --> FUSION
    FUSION -->|insufficient quality| UNKNOWN[INSUFFICIENT]
    FUSION -->|calm / warmup| SAFE[WARMING or SAFE]
    FUSION -->|combined evidence| CAND[CANDIDATE]
    CAND -->|0.5 s sustained| VERIFY[VERIFY]
    VERIFY -->|1.5 s sustained| SHADOW[SHADOW_ALERT]
    SHADOW -. no production side effect .-> VIEWER[API and Viewer only]
    CAND --> HOT[P0 pose priority for 3 s]
    VERIFY --> HOT
    SHADOW --> HOT
